{"3258560": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "I'm No Demonlord", "steam_appid": 3258560, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Discord</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/extras/48b616d2cd2ab866e8a06615ea344a0d.avif?t=1787219823\" width=614 height=168 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't miss the latest updates on [Discord / YouTube / X]!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow and add us—we’re waiting for you! Check out the community information on the right!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/extras/e59a7b437fc38d49a2f691ea726acd57.avif?t=1787219823\" width=615 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once upon a time, a legendary archmage sacrificed himself to cast a magical seal on a supervillain, allowing the kingdom to prosper. But when the king began arresting commoners without reason, the vanished people were never seen again. One day, the seal weakened, the demon king escaped, and possessed the player's adventurer character. Can he accept his new identity? Uncover the king's plot? Save &quot;kinds&quot; or destroy &quot;outsiders&quot;? Good or evil? It's your choice...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/extras/c430f62358d70d6e9c82d1cdc398bb68.avif?t=1787219823\" width=615 height=150 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Round up your friends for an adventure! The game currently supports both remote play and local co-op for two players. So, grab your buddy and join the adventure together! The mysterious plot awaits your discovery!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/extras/378fc2f5c1d14b5514cfd3cb7859349b.poster.avif?t=1787219823\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/extras/378fc2f5c1d14b5514cfd3cb7859349b.webm?t=1787219823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/extras/378fc2f5c1d14b5514cfd3cb7859349b.mp4?t=1787219823\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/extras/97616a21460d4d4f35eee39dcdc45c57.poster.avif?t=1787219823\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/extras/97616a21460d4d4f35eee39dcdc45c57.webm?t=1787219823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/extras/97616a21460d4d4f35eee39dcdc45c57.mp4?t=1787219823\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/extras/9bb5d8a5621c9be624efbc43ae37a15f.poster.avif?t=1787219823\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/extras/9bb5d8a5621c9be624efbc43ae37a15f.webm?t=1787219823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258560/extras/9bb5d8a5621c9be624efbc43ae37a15f.mp4?t=1787219823\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>